Package: gtfsaccess
Title: Simple Tools for Public Transport Accessibility Analysis Using GTFS
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Sushma", "Ghimire", email = "ghimiresushma99@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: gtfsaccess provides tools for deriving transit accessibility 
            from GTFS data by generating stop service areas, integrating gridded population data, 
            computing accessibility indices, and summarizing accessibility across administrative districts.
